                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Beam / soak order (AutoBlock only)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pass → Soak (default): the beam is let through as soon as the temperature is stable, so the sample soak also absorbs the heating by the pump beam before the peak search.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Soak → Pass: the beam stays blocked through the soak and is then let through. Both orders add the full Beam settle wait after soak and beam pass, before peak search or measurement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Only used when AutoBlock is on in a temperature scan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
